WEBVTT

00:03.230 --> 00:06.970
I've got prime-grade wyvern meat today!

00:06.970 --> 00:08.610
First come, first served!

00:08.940 --> 00:14.300
<b>Leoport, Beastmen Continent</b>

00:09.020 --> 00:11.720
We've got a huge harvest of Cetus over here!

00:11.720 --> 00:13.500
Come on over!

00:14.980 --> 00:16.760
Hey, Shironeko-chan!

00:16.760 --> 00:19.460
What a huge backpack. Are you back from work?

00:19.460 --> 00:20.950
Have some fish.

00:21.280 --> 00:22.960
Thank you.

00:23.230 --> 00:25.340
Hey, Little Miss Shironeko!

00:25.340 --> 00:27.620
Big catch you've got there today, as always!

00:27.620 --> 00:29.340
Take some of our meat, too!

00:29.620 --> 00:30.940
I'm grateful.

00:31.580 --> 00:33.170
Hey, Shironeko-chan.

00:33.170 --> 00:36.140
Don't forget to eat vegetables, too. 
You need them to grow bigger.

00:36.140 --> 00:39.600
And don't skip the fruits. 
They're great for beauty.

00:39.600 --> 00:43.900
E-Everyone... I feel bad 
accepting so many gifts.

00:43.900 --> 00:48.420
It's the least we can do to thank you 
for your help with the supply chains.

00:48.420 --> 00:51.160
Kids shouldn't be modest.

00:51.160 --> 00:53.220
Just say thanks and take it all away!

00:53.220 --> 00:55.750
You have to take care of 
your little sister, right?

00:55.750 --> 00:58.120
Beastmen look after each other.

00:58.620 --> 00:59.580
Everyone...

01:00.230 --> 01:02.790
Thank you so very much.

01:02.790 --> 01:05.750
I promise I'll repay you.

01:08.050 --> 01:13.770
Hey, Shironeko! Teach me how 
to beat up monsters again!

01:13.770 --> 01:18.060
Me, too! I want to be strong like you!

01:18.060 --> 01:22.300
No. Fighting is my job.

01:22.300 --> 01:24.890
Your job as kids is to play.

01:25.110 --> 01:28.650
Shironeko-chan! Have some of our milk, too!

01:29.040 --> 01:31.650
We also have fresh soup, just off the cooker!

01:32.580 --> 01:37.480
I-I appreciate it, but I can't carry any more.

01:51.240 --> 01:52.800
I'm home.

01:53.190 --> 01:55.550
Mineko, I'm home.

01:56.930 --> 01:58.800
Welcome home, Sister.

01:59.900 --> 02:02.240
I see everyone loves you as much as ever.

02:04.750 --> 02:09.430
I'll go hand out the food we can't eat
 to the people who need it, again.

02:09.430 --> 02:11.590
Yes, good idea.

02:13.020 --> 02:13.940
Mineko!

02:37.150 --> 02:39.470
I'm sorry, Sister.

02:41.560 --> 02:45.430
I swear I'll make you well.

02:46.550 --> 02:49.440
So you have to do your best, too.

02:50.050 --> 02:51.660
That's a promise.

02:53.170 --> 02:56.350
Yes, I'll do my best.

02:56.860 --> 02:58.190
It's a promise.

04:41.420 --> 04:45.970
<b><i>Episode 7</i></b>

04:41.420 --> 04:45.970
<b><i>Visiting the Beastmen Continent for a Second Time</i></b>

04:46.270 --> 04:51.160
Huh? You can't just barge in out of the blue 
and expect a boat to be available.

04:51.160 --> 04:52.520
Go away, human.

04:52.850 --> 04:55.600
No, seriously, we have urgent business.

04:55.600 --> 04:58.200
I'll pay you, and we won't complain.

04:58.200 --> 05:00.210
I'll ride on your back if I have to.

05:00.210 --> 05:03.290
I'm not a boat! Just go away!

05:04.290 --> 05:05.870
Well, you heard him.

05:05.870 --> 05:08.280
I guess you'll have to do it.

05:09.790 --> 05:11.380
Did you say something?

05:11.380 --> 05:16.170
I couldn't hear you after spending the 
last three days and nights swimming!

05:16.480 --> 05:18.340
Uh, sorry.

05:18.340 --> 05:21.920
You're just the only one I can 
rely on for stuff like this.

05:21.920 --> 05:23.550
I pushed you too hard.

05:26.940 --> 05:30.010
You should have said that first.

05:30.010 --> 05:34.560
Well, if you'll let me rest until 
tomorrow, I can swim again.

05:35.070 --> 05:37.180
There's a boat available tomorrow.

05:37.180 --> 05:39.940
Oh, for real? Thanks, man.

05:40.390 --> 05:43.660
Could you two read the room a little?!

05:43.660 --> 05:45.730
C'mon, don't be mad.

05:45.730 --> 05:49.950
Let's get something nice to eat 
and sleep in a bed for a change!

05:50.940 --> 05:52.470
There's an inn nearby.

05:52.470 --> 05:54.450
Cool. Let's go, Levia.

06:08.280 --> 06:13.010
Thank you, as always, for finding 
this expensive medicine.

06:14.430 --> 06:17.770
Don't worry. I'd do this for you anytime.

06:18.200 --> 06:24.440
Besides, I can't help but cheer on a girl 
working hard to look after her little sister.

06:26.130 --> 06:28.570
Kuroinu-san, do you have siblings, too?

06:30.980 --> 06:35.550
More importantly, this next 
job might be a bit of trouble.

06:37.040 --> 06:38.050
Is this...

06:39.800 --> 06:42.080
an assassination?

06:42.450 --> 06:44.880
If you complete this job,

06:44.880 --> 06:48.470
you'll get paid so handsomely, you'll never 
have to work a day in your life again.

06:48.470 --> 06:53.470
With that kind of money, you'll have 
no problem paying for medicine.

06:56.220 --> 06:57.500
Kuroinu-san...

06:58.600 --> 07:02.620
You're such a sea god abuser, human.

07:02.620 --> 07:05.710
I'm really craving something sweet now.

07:05.710 --> 07:07.730
Fine, fine.

07:07.970 --> 07:10.950
Welcome. Are you looking for a place to stay?

07:10.950 --> 07:12.850
Yeah. Two people, one night.

07:12.850 --> 07:13.990
Any open rooms?

07:14.260 --> 07:16.990
I'd like a room with a fluffy bed, please.

07:21.450 --> 07:25.630
Oh, and is there anywhere around 
here where I can get some good food?

07:25.630 --> 07:30.430
Well, there's a fine diner nearby that 
serves traditional Beastmen cuisine.

07:30.430 --> 07:34.140
I want something sweet. Or fish.

07:40.690 --> 07:43.130
Mineko, are you finished?

07:43.620 --> 07:44.520
Yes...

07:44.920 --> 07:47.150
I'm very full.

07:47.380 --> 07:51.230
I'm sorry... After all the trouble 
you went through to prepare this...

07:54.140 --> 07:56.800
Sister? What's wrong?

07:56.800 --> 07:58.610
It's nothing.

07:58.610 --> 08:01.420
I have one more job to do today,

08:01.420 --> 08:04.040
so you should go to bed without me.

08:38.140 --> 08:39.870
I think they fell asleep.

08:42.140 --> 08:43.740
Are you still hesitating?

08:46.860 --> 08:50.180
No. I've made up my mind.

08:53.600 --> 08:54.860
Kuroinu-san.

08:55.680 --> 08:56.780
Um...

08:58.030 --> 09:01.310
Can I call you... Sister?

09:02.470 --> 09:04.310
You're the reason orphans like us

09:04.310 --> 09:06.980
were able to survive until now.

09:07.430 --> 09:11.100
And it's not just the medicine for Mineko. It's because you took care of us.

09:12.130 --> 09:16.360
So to me, you're like a big sister.

09:16.830 --> 09:19.620
After we get paid for this job,

09:19.620 --> 09:24.600
I was wondering if the three of us 
could live together somewhere quiet.

09:24.600 --> 09:27.130
I thought that might be fun.

09:29.550 --> 09:31.880
That's quite selfish of you.

09:34.500 --> 09:35.760
But I guess...

09:39.040 --> 09:42.390
You can call me whatever you want.

09:44.130 --> 09:46.980
It's not a bad feeling, having a little sister.

09:47.490 --> 09:52.860
Get this job done so you don't make Mineko sad.

09:54.990 --> 09:57.740
I promise I will, Big Sister Kuroinu!

10:09.970 --> 10:11.450
"Big Sister," huh?

10:15.140 --> 10:17.200
Haven't heard that in a while.

10:39.280 --> 10:40.880
Illusion magic?!

10:40.880 --> 10:42.530
That's right.

10:53.680 --> 10:55.200
Not bad.

10:55.200 --> 10:55.920
Setsu!

10:58.190 --> 11:00.370
Are you one of Toma's goons, too?

11:00.370 --> 11:05.260
I don't know who that is, 
but I must take your life.

11:05.600 --> 11:06.910
Partial beast transformation!

11:09.190 --> 11:11.700
Huh, that's a cool move.

11:15.430 --> 11:16.530
Here I come!

11:21.610 --> 11:22.530
Wha—

11:24.780 --> 11:27.540
Don't blast that off in the middle of town!

11:27.540 --> 11:28.950
That's dangerous!

11:49.390 --> 11:51.890
Is this curse magic?

11:51.890 --> 11:54.320
Yeah, no doubt.

11:54.320 --> 11:57.670
She must have brought it from somewhere.

12:17.450 --> 12:19.170
Hey, are you awake?

12:20.440 --> 12:21.380
You!

12:21.920 --> 12:23.180
Sister! Stop!

12:23.540 --> 12:24.800
Mineko?

12:25.420 --> 12:30.810
Setsu-san found you unconscious 
and brought you back here.

12:38.490 --> 12:42.690
Well, um, thank you for that.

12:45.040 --> 12:47.160
I think I understand your situation.

12:47.160 --> 12:50.950
You do dangerous jobs for 
your sister's sake, right?

12:55.220 --> 12:58.590
Just so you know, this isn't an illness.

13:03.620 --> 13:04.850
Break Light.

13:13.600 --> 13:15.740
Wh-What is this?

13:16.830 --> 13:18.280
Cursed Magic.

13:19.170 --> 13:23.070
It's not an illness. It's a powerful curse.

13:23.670 --> 13:26.230
And for it to be this powerful...

13:26.790 --> 13:28.300
Is it Toma after all?

13:29.090 --> 13:32.200
For now, we worry about how to save her.

13:33.580 --> 13:38.080
A curse?! Can Mineko... Can Mineko be saved?!

13:38.080 --> 13:41.660
Please! I'll do anything!

13:41.660 --> 13:44.210
Please save Mineko...

13:44.590 --> 13:46.740
Please...

13:48.060 --> 13:52.090
Leave it to me. I'll save your sister for sure.

14:01.850 --> 14:05.490
This might be a bit unpleasant. 
Think you can bear it?

14:06.000 --> 14:06.740
Yes.

14:07.350 --> 14:08.570
Please, go ahead.

14:28.240 --> 14:29.930
Arise, Glutton!

14:53.010 --> 14:55.950
Wh-What is that?

14:56.790 --> 15:00.290
This is my secret trump card.

15:03.360 --> 15:06.730
Glutton, devour this curse!

15:16.670 --> 15:19.730
Mineko! You can do it! Hang in there!

15:29.310 --> 15:32.610
Please don't do that without permission.

15:32.610 --> 15:34.320
Setsu! Watch out!

15:40.410 --> 15:41.330
What?!

15:41.330 --> 15:42.810
Hey, Shironeko!

15:47.490 --> 15:51.930
Not only were you unable to execute 
my order, but you protect the target?

15:51.930 --> 15:53.980
She's the innkeeper!

15:55.180 --> 15:57.870
But I can't stop this now...

15:58.430 --> 16:03.230
Setsu the Hero. I, Kuroinu, 
will take you into custody.

16:09.150 --> 16:13.120
How insolent of you to ignore me.

16:14.210 --> 16:15.280
Levia!

16:15.550 --> 16:18.030
She's pretty strong. Can you handle her?!

16:18.030 --> 16:21.320
Who do you think you're talking to?
I'm the god of the sea.

16:24.060 --> 16:25.900
Hah. Empty words.

16:29.380 --> 16:31.690
That magic power... There's no doubt.

16:32.240 --> 16:35.590
Why is a sea god working with a human?

16:35.850 --> 16:39.470
Enough chit-chat. Let's get it on already.

16:39.920 --> 16:45.100
Can you, a god of the sea, 
wield your power on land?

16:50.980 --> 16:53.560
Your life is mine!

16:56.950 --> 16:58.650
Too bad for you.

17:08.040 --> 17:09.260
Sea water?!

17:10.250 --> 17:13.800
Wherever I am, the sea is, as well!

17:28.910 --> 17:30.190
Answer me.

17:30.530 --> 17:32.220
What is Toma after?

17:35.320 --> 17:38.820
If you answer honestly, 
I won't take your life.

17:40.960 --> 17:44.060
Pleading for my life is far beneath me.

17:44.060 --> 17:45.640
Big Sister Kuroinu...

17:49.600 --> 17:52.840
Why would you do this?

17:53.710 --> 17:55.340
Shironeko...

17:56.310 --> 18:00.350
"Big Sister," huh? How revolting.

18:00.670 --> 18:03.100
B-Big Sister?

18:03.490 --> 18:06.760
You pathetic runt, unable to 
execute such a simple order!

18:06.760 --> 18:08.600
How dare you call me your sister?!

18:11.910 --> 18:14.730
I've heard enough.

18:17.310 --> 18:23.620
Toma-sama's goal is to become a god 
and destroy every species in this world.

18:25.000 --> 18:28.370
We are his faithful pawns.

18:28.620 --> 18:32.130
A god? How could a mere human—

18:32.130 --> 18:35.630
<i>He</i> can! Nobody else but him!

18:48.160 --> 18:49.400
She got away.

18:52.400 --> 18:53.460
Sister!

18:54.690 --> 18:55.920
Mineko?!

18:58.160 --> 19:00.320
Mineko, are you all right?

19:00.570 --> 19:05.240
Yes! I'm fine. I'm fine now, Sister!

19:08.730 --> 19:10.460
Looks like it worked out.

19:10.710 --> 19:13.040
Yeah, thanks to you.

19:14.560 --> 19:17.450
This is the same necklace Dezas had.

19:17.450 --> 19:20.000
Toma is trying to be a god now?

19:20.000 --> 19:22.150
Still a total wack job, isn't he?

19:22.470 --> 19:25.970
But if he's trying to destroy this world...

19:26.340 --> 19:29.370
Yeah. I'll have to stop him, 
by punching him if I have to.

20:05.550 --> 20:08.730
I thought we were finally going 
to get a good night's sleep,

20:08.730 --> 20:11.010
but last night ended up 
being another big mess.

20:11.010 --> 20:14.440
Yeah, what a waste of a good bed.

20:17.500 --> 20:21.530
But now we really do have 
to meet with the Beast King.

20:21.770 --> 20:27.470
Yeah. Who would've thought we'd fight side 
by side with them for world peace again?

20:30.170 --> 20:31.150
Is that...

20:33.670 --> 20:35.270
Hey, stop over there.

20:35.270 --> 20:36.150
You got it.

20:37.960 --> 20:42.670
If you're going to fight, 
please take us along.

20:43.220 --> 20:47.060
The two of us together 
would be useful in combat.

20:47.560 --> 20:50.300
If you're going to Regdom, 
the royal capital,

20:50.300 --> 20:52.560
you should take a Beastman with you.

20:53.010 --> 20:56.190
I also need to repay you for helping Mineko.

20:56.760 --> 20:58.190
Besides...

20:58.770 --> 21:03.820
I want to see Big Sister Kuroinu 
again, and talk to her.

21:03.820 --> 21:05.240
You guys...

21:13.680 --> 21:16.460
It's going to be a tough fight. Are you sure?

21:20.790 --> 21:24.300
All right, then. Shall we?

21:24.540 --> 21:25.360
Yes!

21:32.510 --> 21:34.290
Okay, let's go.

21:34.290 --> 21:34.960
Got it.

21:45.230 --> 21:46.990
Just you wait, Toma.

23:26.980 --> 23:32.000
<b><i>Next Time</i></b>

23:26.980 --> 23:32.000
<b><i>Fighting a Duel for a Second Time</i></b>

23:28.090 --> 23:31.090
Next time: "Fighting a 
Duel for a Second Time."
